      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is a heavy and frightening feeling to be the \"black hole\" everyone dread to enter, and you have every right to stop trying to be the solution to the exhaustion you are projecting. Your mother's exhaustion likely stems from the intense emotional weight you are shouldering alone, which is often a sign that the wave you are drowning in is too powerful to be quiet at home. Recognizing this pattern is a crucial first step to breaking the cycle, but that can feel impossible when you believe you have no self at all.",
