    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just wish i could fix it for them. like, if i wasn't part of the equation, they could finally just breathe. they wouldn't have to worry about my moods or my issues or how to fix me. it feels like the only way to actually be good to them is to just... not be an issue anymore. to just step out of the way.",
